","kind":"announcement","title":"Only execution awaits the defeated. “Trials of the Demonic Seal” Store Page Revealed","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45154898/adf117f579499fcb35a979c34d7ee074b81ec5e8.gif About Game Trials of the Demonic Seal is a Roguelite action game set in a dark fantasy world. Players assume the role of captured adventurers attempting to break through the constant attacks and rigorous challenges laid out by the demon. You must survive the cruel environment and try to escape. Throughout the trials, the demonic mark will continuously erode the captives' will. Failure means merciless","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-11T14:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592123980","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2685440-1818118366175467","game_id":"steam-2685440","kind":"announcement","title":"情慾與宿命交織的黑暗修仙之旅 《緋月仙行錄》商店公開！","summary":"*Only in Chinese https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45154898/5b80dadd00d139a540b12ba67835f4a7af2feddb.png 【遊戲簡介】 你曾是列強「六周國」的公主，在國破家亡後，踏上了復仇與修仙的漫長旅程。在這趟旅程中，你必須面對各方勢力的威脅，從亂兵流氓、邪惡魔修、到強大的宗門大能。 你的身心與命運將不斷遭受考驗與踐踏，而你需要在殘酷的修仙界中做出抉擇，是堅持道心、尋求力量？抑或沉淪於無盡的慾望與屈辱之中？還是索性成為「紅塵快樂仙」？ 這是一款黑暗、充滿宿命與情慾的修仙 RPG 遊戲。你的每一個決定都將導向不同的結局，決定你是否能復仇成功，或是走向永恆的禁錮與奴役。 https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45154898/8b07b765e154e84cc81485b4c0847ab6fc376028.jpg 【遊戲特色】 戰鬥渡劫、陰陽雙修、吸收精氣、提升境界、修仙飛升！ 30 種支線任務，豐富多彩的遊戲世界 自由選擇的多樣結局 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-05T08:57:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366175467","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2685440-1817483467044995","game_id":"steam-2685440","kind":"announcement","title":"Over 250